TC DSS Phase3 CellSetup
    [Documentation]                Generic test for 1745: test purpose is to setup X2, Xp and DSS CellSetup Phase3
    [Arguments]                    ${param}     ${alias}=default
    Init Sequence                  ${param}
    common_Dss_Keywords.Restart     OwnTLReset=${False}    GNBCallback=common_Dss_Keywords.Set Reset Loop Counter
    Step                           Start capture Backhaul XP for DSS    argument=BH.XP.DssCellSetup   depends=common_Dss_Keywords.Restart
    Step                           Start WTS                    argument=${alias}
    Step                           Check wts in active state    argument=${alias}        depends=Start WTS
    Step                           Wait Xp link Up              argument=${alias}        depends=Start WTS
    Step                           X2Ap link Setup             argument=${alias}         depends=Start WTS
    Step                           common_Dss_CellSetup.DSS_CRM_Cell_Setup_Phase3    argument=${alias}        depends=Wait Xp link Up
    ${pdmlFile}                    Stop capture Backhaul XP for DSS
    Run Keyword if       '${CELLSETUP_SHOULD_BE_CHECK}' == '1'
    ...      Step    common_Dss_CellSetup.Check DSS CellSetup Phase3    argument=${pdmlFile}  depends=common_Dss_CellSetup.DSS_CRM_Cell_Setup_Phase3
    Critical Step                  common_Dss_CellSetup.Verify AP Classical Cell Setup
    [Teardown]               GenericTest.Display diagnosis

TC 2574 CellSetup wo CRM CatM Config
    [Documentation]    Test for 2574: test purpose is to setup X2, Xp and DSS CellSetup Phase3 wo CRM CatM Config
    ...              When L2-PS receives a EN_DSS_DL_CELL_RESOURCE_AREA_ALLOCATION_REQUEST with Extension_01 and
    ...              it doesnt received yet CatMinfo in PsCell_DssCellCrmClientCfgReq (during DL Coordination) received from CP-RT,
    ...              L2-PS answers EN_DSS_DL_CELL_RESOURCE_AREA_ALLOCATION_FAILURE with EN DSS Failure Cause (Subcarrier AllocationFailure)
    ...              EN_DSS_DL_CELL_RESOURCE_AREA_ALLOCATION_FAILURE with EN DSS Failure Cause is checked in DSS_CRM_Cell_Setup_Phase3_Failure_case
    ...              actLteNrDssLteCatM activation in gNB is checked in cellSetupreq l2 cprt itf
    [Arguments]                    ${param}     ${alias}=default
    Init Sequence                  ${param}
    common_Dss_Keywords.Restart     OwnTLReset=${False}     GNBCallback=common_Dss_Keywords.Set Reset Loop Counter
    Step                           Start capture Backhaul XP for DSS
    Step                           Start WTS                         argument=${alias}
    Step                           Check wts in active state         argument=${alias}        depends=Start WTS
    Step                           Wait Xp link Up                   argument=${alias}        depends=Start WTS
    Step                           X2Ap link Setup                   argument=${alias}        depends=Start WTS
    Step                           common_Dss_CellSetup.DSS_CRM_Cell_Setup_Phase3_Failure_case    argument=${alias}        depends=Wait Xp link Up
    ${pdmlFile}                    Stop capture Backhaul XP for DSS
    Step                           common_Dss_CellSetup.Check DSS CellSetup CatM Capabilities for Failure test case   argument=${pdmlFile}
    ...                                                                    depends=common_Dss_CellSetup.DSS_CRM_Cell_Setup_Phase3_Failure_case
    # Step                           common_Dss_Keywords.Check DSS Active Alarms   argument=7512
    sleep          2
    [Teardown]       GenericTest.Display diagnosis

Check enDssDlCellResourceAreaCoordinationUpdateInd inside Pcap
    [Documentation]      KW used to check enDssDlCellResourceAreaCoordinationUpdateIndCellSetup inside PCAP file
    [Arguments]                     ${pcapFile}
    ...                             ${dlAllocationSequenceNumber}=00000000
    ...                             ${ulAllocationSequenceNumber}=00000000

    Dated log                   Checking DL CELL RESOURCE AREA COORDINATION Update procedure inside PCAP file    ${pcapFile}
    BuiltIn.log                 dlAllocationSequenceNumber=${dlAllocationSequenceNumber}
    BuiltIn.log                 ulAllocationSequenceNumber=${ulAllocationSequenceNumber}
# XpDssMessage.XpDssMessage-Discriminator value = 00000029 means enDssDlCellResourceAreaCoordinationUpdateInd
# check enDssDlCellResourceAreaCoordinationUpdateInd
    Dated log                   ---Checking enDssDlCellResourceAreaCoordinationUpdateInd
    ${output}=    nps_2574_tools.check_exists_once    pcapFile=${pcapFile}
    ...                                               packetName=xp_dss_xpdssmessage
    ...                                               packetType=enDssDlCellResourceAreaCoordinationUpdateInd
    should contain     ${output.lower()}    passed

    Dated log                   End checking DL CELL RESOURCE AREA COORDINATION Update procedure inside PCAP file

Check Dss CellSetup inside Pcap
    [Documentation]      KW used to check Dss CellSetup inside PCAP file
    [Arguments]                     ${pcapFile}

    Dated log                   Checking Dss CellSetup procedure inside PCAP file    ${pcapFile}

    ${output}=     nps_2574_tools.verify_5GC002574_Dss_Cellsetup   pcapFile=${pcapFile}
    should contain     ${output.lower()}    passed

    Dated log                   End checking Dss CellSetup procedure inside PCAP file


TC 2574 CellSetup
    [Documentation]                Generic test for 2574: test purpose is to setup X2, Xp and DSS CellSetup Phase3
    [Arguments]                    ${param}     ${alias}=default
    Init Sequence                  ${param}
    common_Dss_Keywords.Restart     OwnTLReset=${False}     GNBCallback=common_Dss_Keywords.Set Reset Loop Counter
    # Step                           common_Dss_Keywords.Start capture for DSS
    Step                           Start capture Backhaul XP for DSS
    Step                           Start WTS                         argument=${alias}
    Step                           Check wts in active state         argument=${alias}        depends=Start WTS
    Step                           Wait Xp link Up                   argument=${alias}        depends=Start WTS
    Step                           X2Ap link Setup                   argument=${alias}        depends=Start WTS
    # Step                           common_Dss_CellSetup.DSS_CRM_Cell_Setup_Phase3    argument=${alias}        depends=Wait Xp link Up
    Step                           common_Dss_CellSetup.DSS_CRM_Cell_Setup_Phase3   alias=${alias}    wtsObj=${wtsObj}    depends=Wait Xp link Up
    # xpskark.lua is used
    Dated log             Point AF_PATH and ENB_BUILD to luashark sw package
    # put back these 2 lines if case of using xpshark.lua delivered by UTE
    # Point ENB_BUILD to luashark sw package
    # Point AF_PATH to current sw package
    # end of adding in case of using xpshark.lua delivered by UTE
    # 21/03/2022 : add 2 next lines to go back to local Xpshark lua !!!!
    Point AF_PATH to local luashark XP package
    Point ENB_BUILD to local luashark XP package
    # end of adding
    ${pdmlFile}                    Stop capture Backhaul XP for DSS
    ${mcshark_present}  ${MCShark}=    pcap.Check MCShark if present
    Run Keyword if     "${mcshark_present}"=="True"   pcap.Convert Xp PCAP To CSV using MCShark to check Dss Cellsetup
    ...                                                            pcap_file=${testCaseDir}/${capture_BH_GNB.name}.pcap
    ...                                                            tc_id=2574_CellSetup
    # Check using xpShark.lua
    Run Keyword if       '${CELLSETUP_SHOULD_BE_CHECK}' == '1' and "${mcshark_present}"=="False"
    ...      Step    common_Dss_CellSetup.Check DSS CellSetup Phase3    argument=${pdmlFile}  depends=common_Dss_CellSetup.DSS_CRM_Cell_Setup_Phase3
    Run Keyword if       '${CELLSETUP_SHOULD_BE_CHECK}' == '1' and "${mcshark_present}"=="False"
    ...      Step    common_Dss_CellSetup.Check enDssDlCellResourceAreaCoordinationUpdateInd    argument=${pdmlFile}
    ...                                                                                      depends=common_Dss_CellSetup.DSS_CRM_Cell_Setup_Phase3
    Run Keyword if       '${CELLSETUP_SHOULD_BE_CHECK}' == '1' and "${mcshark_present}"=="False"
    ...  Step  common_Dss_CellSetup.Check DSS CellSetup CatM Capabilities  argument=${pdmlFile}
    ...                                                                    depends=common_Dss_CellSetup.DSS_CRM_Cell_Setup_Phase3
    Run Keyword if       '${CELLSETUP_SHOULD_BE_CHECK}' == '1' and "${mcshark_present}"=="False"
    ...  Step  common_Dss_CellSetup.Check DSS CellSetup CatMInfo  argument=${testCaseDir}/${capture_BH_GNB.name}.pcap
    ...                                                           depends=common_Dss_CellSetup.DSS_CRM_Cell_Setup_Phase3
    # Check using MCShark
    Run Keyword if   '${CELLSETUP_SHOULD_BE_CHECK}'=='1' and "${mcshark_present}"=="True"
    ...       Step    Check Dss CellSetup inside Pcap    argument=${testCaseDir}/${capture_BH_GNB.name}.pcap
    ...                                                  depends=common_Dss_CellSetup.DSS_CRM_Cell_Setup_Phase3
    Run Keyword if   '${CELLSETUP_SHOULD_BE_CHECK}'=='1' and "${mcshark_present}"=="True"
    ...       Step    Check enDssDlCellResourceAreaCoordinationUpdateInd inside Pcap      argument=${testCaseDir}/${capture_BH_GNB.name}.pcap
    ...                                                                                   depends=common_Dss_CellSetup.DSS_CRM_Cell_Setup_Phase3
    Run Keyword if   '${CELLSETUP_SHOULD_BE_CHECK}'=='1' and "${mcshark_present}"=="True"
    ...       Step    common_Dss_CellSetup.Check DSS CellSetup CatM Capabilities Using MCShark
    ...                                                                    argument=${testCaseDir}/${capture_BH_GNB.name}.pcap
    ...                                                                    depends=common_Dss_CellSetup.DSS_CRM_Cell_Setup_Phase3
    Run Keyword if       '${CELLSETUP_SHOULD_BE_CHECK}'=='1' and "${mcshark_present}"=="True"
    ...    common_Dss_CellSetup.Check DSS CellSetup CatMInfo using MCShark
    ...                                                           pcapFile=${testCaseDir}/${capture_BH_GNB.name}.pcap
    ...                                                           lua_script=None
    # ...                                                           depends=common_Dss_CellSetup.DSS_CRM_Cell_Setup_Phase3

    # Wait gNB cell 5g On air with globalCellId=1
    Run Keyword if       '${param.Context.WtsWaitingPattern}' == 'Received DSS DL Resource Area Allocation Response'
    ...  Critical Step                  common_Dss_CellSetup.Wait gNB cell 5g On air     globalCellId=1
    Run Keyword if       '${param.Context.WtsWaitingPattern}' == 'Received DSS DL Resource Area Allocation Response'
    ...  Critical Step                  common_Dss_CellSetup.Verify AP Classical Cell Setup
    [Teardown]       Run Keywords     Run Keyword And Ignore Error    OperatingSystem.File Should Exist   ${pcapprocessed_CatMInfo_path}    AND
    ...                               Run Keyword And Ignore Error    OperatingSystem.Move File  ${pcapprocessed_CatMInfo_path}  ${testCaseDir}  AND
    ...                               GenericTest.Display diagnosis


TC 2574 CellSetup to check CPRT CatM activation
    [Documentation]                Generic test for 2574: test purpose is to setup X2, Xp and DSS CellSetup Phase3
    [Arguments]                    ${param}     ${alias}=default
    Init Sequence                  ${param}
    common_Dss_Keywords.Restart     OwnTLReset=${False}     GNBCallback=common_Dss_Keywords.Set Reset Loop Counter
    Step                           Start Capture CPRT
    Step                           Start WTS                         argument=${alias}
    Step                           Check wts in active state    argument=${alias}        depends=Start WTS
    Step                           Wait Xp link Up              argument=${alias}        depends=Start WTS
    Step                           X2Ap link Setup                   argument=${alias}        depends=Start WTS
    Step                           common_Dss_CellSetup.DSS_CRM_Cell_Setup_Phase3    argument=${alias}        depends=Wait Xp link Up
    # Step                           Stop Capture CPRT and convert to pdml                      depends=Start Capture CPRT
    Step                           Stop Capture CPRT                      depends=Start Capture CPRT
    Dated log             Point AF_PATH and ENB_BUILD to luashark sw package
    Point ENB_BUILD to luashark sw package
    Point AF_PATH to current sw package
    # luasShark case
    Run Keyword if   "${mcshark_present}"=="False"   Step         Check actLteNrDssLteCatM in cellSetupreq Pcap        argument=${CaptureCPRT.path}
    ...                                                                                 depends=Stop Capture CPRT
    Run Keyword if   "${mcshark_present}"=="False"   Step         Check actLteNrDssFastAlloc in cellSetupreq Pcap      argument=${CaptureCPRT.path}
    ...                                                                                 depends=Stop Capture CPRT
    Run Keyword if   "${mcshark_present}"=="False"   Step         Display DSS and CatM Info from cellSetup Pcap        argument=${CaptureCPRT.path}
    ...                                                                                 depends=Stop Capture CPRT
    Run Keyword if   "${mcshark_present}"=="False"   Step         Display DSS and CatM Info from itf_l2_ps_cell_DssCellCrmClientCfgReq Pcap
    ...                                                                                 argument=${CaptureCPRT.path}
    ...                                                                                 depends=Stop Capture CPRT
    Run Keyword if   "${mcshark_present}"=="False"   Step         Check CatM Info from itf_l2_ps_cell_DssCellCrmClientCfgReq Pcap
    ...                                                                                 argument=${CaptureCPRT.path}
    ...                                                                                 depends=Stop Capture CPRT
    Run Keyword if   "${mcshark_present}"=="False"   Step         common_Dss_CellSetup.Check DSS CellSetup CatMInfo  argument=${CaptureCPRT.path}
    ...                                                                                 depends=common_Dss_CellSetup.DSS_CRM_Cell_Setup_Phase3
    # mcShark case
    Run Keyword if   "${mcshark_present}"=="True"   Step     Check actLteNrDssLteCatM in cellSetupreq Pcap     argument=${CaptureCPRT.path}
    ...                                                                                 depends=Stop Capture CPRT
    Run Keyword if   "${mcshark_present}"=="True"   Step     Check actLteNrDssFastAlloc in cellSetupreq Pcap     argument=${CaptureCPRT.path}
    ...                                                                                 depends=Stop Capture CPRT
    Run Keyword if   "${mcshark_present}"=="True"   Step     Display DSS and CatM Info from cellSetup Pcap    argument=${CaptureCPRT.path}
    ...                                                                                 depends=Stop Capture CPRT
    Run Keyword if   "${mcshark_present}"=="True"   Step     Display DSS and CatM Info from itf_l2_ps_cell_DssCellCrmClientCfgReq Pcap Using McShark
    ...                                                                                 argument=${CaptureCPRT.path}
    ...                                                                                 depends=Stop Capture CPRT
    Run Keyword if   "${mcshark_present}"=="True"   Step     Check CatM Info from itf_l2_ps_cell_DssCellCrmClientCfgReq Pcap Using McShark
    ...                                                                                 argument=${CaptureCPRT.path}
    ...                                                                                 depends=Stop Capture CPRT
    Run Keyword if   "${mcshark_present}"=="True"   Step     common_Dss_CellSetup.Check DSS CellSetup CatMInfo using MCShark
    ...                                                                                 ${CaptureCPRT.path}
    ...                                                                                 lua_script=None
    ...                                                                                 depends=Stop Capture CPRT
    Critical Step                  common_Dss_CellSetup.Verify AP Classical Cell Setup
    [Teardown]       Run Keywords      Run Keyword And Ignore Error    OperatingSystem.File Should Exist   ${CaptureCPRT.path}      AND
    ...   Run Keyword And Ignore Error    OperatingSystem.Copy File    ${CaptureCPRT.path}    ${testCaseDir}    AND
    ...   Run Keyword And Ignore Error    OperatingSystem.Move File  ${pcapprocessed_CatMInfo_CPRT_path}  ${testCaseDir}  AND
    ...   Run Keyword And Ignore Error    OperatingSystem.Move File  ${pcapprocessed_DssFastAlloc_CPRT_path}  ${testCaseDir}  AND
    ...   Run Keyword And Ignore Error    OperatingSystem.Move File  ${pcapprocessed_CatMInfo_DssCellCrmClientCfgReq_CPRT_path}  ${testCaseDir}  AND
    ...   GenericTest.Display diagnosis


# to check that we have a lot of enDssDlCellSubframeResourceCoordinationReq retx (Failure case)
Check Nbr enDssDlCellResourceAreaCoordinationReq
    [Arguments]    ${pdmlFile}
    ${cmd}=      Catenate    egrep -n -i enDssDlCellResourceAreaCoordinationReq ${pdmlFile} | wc -l
    ...                          > ${testCaseDir}/nbr_enDssDlCellResourceAreaCoordinationReq_parsed.txt
    OperatingSystem.Run     ${cmd}
    ${output}    OperatingSystem.Run     cat ${testCaseDir}/nbr_enDssDlCellResourceAreaCoordinationReq_parsed.txt
    Should Be True    ${output}>5       enDssDlCellResourceAreaCoordinationReq is not repeated as expected!!!


TC 2574 CellSetup Coordination Failure Case
    [Documentation]                Generic test for 2574: test purpose is to setup X2, Xp and DSS CellSetup Phase3 Failure Case
    ...                            Check alarm 7517 is raised (EFaultId_EnDssDlCellCoordDssConfigError5gAl)
    ...                            EN DSS DL Cell Coordination Failure - DSS configuration Error
    [Arguments]                    ${param}     ${alias}=default
    Init Sequence                  ${param}
    common_Dss_Keywords.Restart     OwnTLReset=${False}     GNBCallback=common_Dss_Keywords.Set Reset Loop Counter
    Step                  Start capture Backhaul XP for DSS
    Step                  Start WTS                         argument=${alias}
    Step                  Check wts in active state         argument=${alias}        depends=Start WTS
    Step                  Wait Xp link Up                   argument=${alias}        depends=Start WTS
    Step                  X2Ap link Setup                   argument=${alias}        depends=Start WTS
    Step                  common_Dss_CellSetup.DSS_CRM_Cell_Setup_Phase3_DL_Coordination_Failure_case    argument=${alias}    depends=Wait Xp link Up
    ${pdmlFile}           Stop capture Backhaul XP for DSS
    Step                  Check Nbr enDssDlCellResourceAreaCoordinationReq     argument=${pdmlFile}
    ...                                                                        depends=DSS_CRM_Cell_Setup_Phase3_DL_Coordination_Failure_case
    BuiltIn.Log    \n Nbr enDssDlCellResourceAreaCoordinationReq > 5 \n    console=yes
    Dated log     \tNbr enDssDlCellResourceAreaCoordinationReq > 5
    Step                  common_Dss_Keywords.Check DSS Active Alarms   argument=7517
    [Teardown]       GenericTest.Display diagnosis


