Check DSSCounterState
    [Documentation]                 M55332C03002  EN_DSS_MAX_RTT_TO_CRM
    ...                             M55332C03003 and M55332C03004
    [Arguments]         ${expValueM55332C03002}    ${expValueM55332C03003}    ${expValueM55332C03004}

    Dated Log New Line          =================================================================
    Dated Log           PM Counter M55332C03002 M55332C03003 and M55332C03004 analysis
    Dated Log          =================================================================
    ${val1}=    Counters.Retrieve Sum of Values Counter From Pm Files with CellID
    ...        ${log_path_pm}    &{PM_Counter_Status_Cell_M55332C03002}
    Dated Log           Value of ${PM_Counter_Status_Cell_M55332C03002} ${val1} in Cell  expected ${expValueM55332C03002}

    ${val2}=    Counters.Retrieve Sum of Values Counter From Pm Files with CellID
    ...        ${log_path_pm}    &{PM_Counter_Status_Cell_M55332C03003}
    Dated Log           Value of ${PM_Counter_Status_Cell_M55332C03003} ${val2} in Cell  expected ${expValueM55332C03003}

    ${val3}=    Counters.Retrieve Sum of Values Counter From Pm Files with CellID
    ...        ${log_path_pm}    &{PM_Counter_Status_Cell_M55332C03004}
    Dated Log           Value of ${PM_Counter_Status_Cell_M55332C03004} ${val3} in Cell  expected ${expValueM55332C03004}

    should be true      ${val1} <= ${expValueM55332C03002}
    should be true      ${val2} <= ${expValueM55332C03003}
    should be true      ${val3} <= ${expValueM55332C03004}

Verify xL tput
    [Documentation]  deviation in percent
    ...              retun True or False
    [Arguments]    ${dir}=UL    ${tput_value}=1    ${expect_tput_value}=1    ${tput_deviation}=5

    run keyword if    ${expect_tput_value}==${0}    run keywords
    ...    should be true    ${tput_value}>=0    AND   return from keyword

    Log to Console   debug: dir ${dir} tput_value ${tput_value} expect_tput_value ${expect_tput_value} deviation ${tput_deviation} %
    ${is_tput_as_expected}  Set Variable    False
    # ${min}    evaluate    ${expect_tput_value}*(1-${deviation})
    # ${max}    evaluate    ${expect_tput_value}*(1+${deviation})
    ${min}    evaluate    ${expect_tput_value}-(${expect_tput_value}*${deviation}/100)
    ${max}    evaluate    ${expect_tput_value}+(${expect_tput_value}*${deviation}/100)
    ${is_tput_as_expected}    evaluate    ${min} <= ${tput_value} <= ${max}
    ${msg}=     Run Keyword If     '${is_tput_as_expected}'=='True'
    ...    Catenate     \t${green} ${dir} Tput for all Ues REACHED: expected = ${expect_tput_value} Mbps,
    ...                            current = ${tput_value} Mbps ${normal}
    ...    ELSE
    ...    Catenate     \t${red} ${dir} Tput for all Ues NOT REACHED: expected = ${expect_tput_value} Mbps,
    ...                          current = ${tput_value} Mbps ${normal}
    Log to Console         ${msg}
    [Return]      ${is_tput_as_expected}

DSS_5g_SA_UL_DL_Traffic
    [Arguments]         ${param}      ${ul_rate}=15      ${dl_rate}=80    ${alias}=default
    [Documentation]
    ...   Start generating Traffic for one UE. It is required to have attached UE and setup choosen bearer before.
    ...
    ...    :param dl_rate:  the volume of downlink traffic in megabits per second. Default value is 1mbit/s.
    ...    :param ul_rate:  the volume of uplink traffic in megabits per second. Default value is 1mbit/s.
    ...    :param ue: UE id

    ${pattern}    Set Variable    UDP DL TRF
    ${cmd}=     Catenate         trf_data_start ue=${Param.Context.UeId1} pdu=1 qfi=1 trf_id=1 mbps=${dl_rate} dir=dl
    ${output}      wts.execute egate command        cmd=${cmd}    pass_regexp=${pattern}    timeout=30    alias=${alias}
    ${pattern}    Set Variable    UDP UL TRF:
    ${cmd}=     Catenate         trf_data_start ue=${Param.Context.UeId1} pdu=1 qfi=1 trf_id=1 mbps=${ul_rate} dir=ul
    ${output}      wts.execute egate command        cmd=${cmd}    pass_regexp=${pattern}     timeout=30    alias=${alias}
    Log to Console     Started DL + UL Traffic for UE=${Param.Context.UeId1}


Stop Generating Traffic
    [Arguments]    ${ue}=1    ${bearer}=2
    [Documentation]    Stop generating traffic for one UE
    ...    :param ue: UE id
    ...    :param bearer: configured bearer
    ...
    Log to Console    Stopping DL + UL Traffic...
    ${output}      wts.execute egate command        cmd=trf_data_stop ue=${ue} id=${bearer}
    # ${output}   wts.read_wtsemu_output_until_re    expected=Traffic was stopped   timeout=10
    # ${output}         Get Lines Matching Regexp    ${output}    Traffic was stopped   partial_match=${TRUE}

CheckInEgateConsoleLog_DldatacsisendReq_sent_in_MSG2_Slot
    [Documentation]    This keyword is used for DSS to check in BackHaul log parameter result after ue_register:
    ...                - in measConfig :  csi-IM-ResourceToAddModList + csi-IM-ResourceElementPattern pattern0
    ...                - in pdschConfig : zp-CSI-RS-ResourceToAddModList
    sleep   5
    ${csi-IM-ResourceToAddModList}                 Set Variable        "csi-IM-ResourceToAddModList"
    ${pattern_zp-CSI-RS-ResourceToAddModList}      Set Variable        "zp-CSI-RS-ResourceToAddModList"
    ${pattern0}                                    Set Variable             "csi-IM-ResourceElementPattern pattern0"


    ${msg}    Catenate    Check in DldatacsisendReq MSG2 in egate_console.log:  ${csi-IM-ResourceToAddModList}
    ...                   ${pattern_zp-CSI-RS-ResourceToAddModList}  and  ${pattern0}
    Dated Log New Line      ${msg}

    ${alias}       SSH Connect          ${HOST_EPCSIM}

    ${cmd}=        Catenate    grep ${csi-IM-ResourceToAddModList} ${tl.core.dir_path}/egate_console.log
    ${output}=     SSH Exec
    ...            command=${cmd}
    ...            alias=${alias}
    ...            debug=${True}
    Dated Log  ${output}
    Should Not Be Empty     ${output}  msg=no ${csi-IM-ResourceToAddModList} found in ${tl.core.dir_path}/egate_console.log



    ${cmd}=    Catenate    grep ${pattern_zp-CSI-RS-ResourceToAddModList} ${tl.core.dir_path}/egate_console.log | grep -v nzp
    ${output}=     SSH Exec
    ...            command=${cmd}
    ...            alias=${alias}
    ...            debug=${True}
    Dated Log  ${output}
    Should Not Be Empty     ${output}  msg=no ${pattern_zp-CSI-RS-ResourceToAddModList} found in ${tl.core.dir_path}/egate_console.log

    ${cmd}=    Catenate    grep -e ${pattern0} ${tl.core.dir_path}/egate_console.log
    ${output}=     SSH Exec
    ...            command=${cmd}
    ...            alias=${alias}
    ...            debug=${True}
    Dated Log  ${output}
    Should Not Be Empty     ${output}  msg=no ${pattern0} found in ${tl.core.dir_path}/egate_console.log

Check 2574 Counters
    [Arguments]         ${sum_prb_over_5min}=0

    ${counter_values_M55308C10001}        Retrieve Latest Single Counter Value From Pm File         ${LATEST_FILE}               M55308C10001
    ${counter_values_M55308C10003}        Retrieve Latest Single Counter Value From Pm File         ${LATEST_FILE}               M55308C10003

    BuiltIn.Log          ***PRBs used for PDSCH (M55308C10001)=${counter_values_M55308C10001}            console=yes
    BuiltIn.Log          ***PRBs available for PDSCH (M55308C10003)=${counter_values_M55308C10003}       console=yes

    ${counter_values_M55332C00001}        Retrieve Latest Single Counter Value From Pm File         ${LATEST_FILE}               M55332C00001
    ${counter_values_M55332C00002}        Retrieve Latest Single Counter Value From Pm File         ${LATEST_FILE}               M55332C00002
    ${counter_values_M55332C00003}        Retrieve Latest Single Counter Value From Pm File         ${LATEST_FILE}               M55332C00003
    ${counter_values_M55332C01001}        Retrieve Latest Single Counter Value From Pm File         ${LATEST_FILE}               M55332C01001

    ${counter_values_M55332C01002}        Retrieve Latest Single Counter Value From Pm File         ${LATEST_FILE}               M55332C01002
    ${counter_values_M55332C01003}        Retrieve Latest Single Counter Value From Pm File         ${LATEST_FILE}               M55332C01003
    ${counter_values_M55332C02001}        Retrieve Latest Single Counter Value From Pm File         ${LATEST_FILE}               M55332C02001
    ${counter_values_M55332C02002}        Retrieve Latest Single Counter Value From Pm File         ${LATEST_FILE}               M55332C02002

    BuiltIn.Log       \n ***DSS DL Ratio: Number of DL Slots assigned to NR (M55332C00001)            console=yes
    BuiltIn.Log          ***DSS DL Ratio: Total number of available DL Slots (M55332C02001)            console=yes
    BuiltIn.Log          ***DSS DL Ratio: M55332C00001=${counter_values_M55332C00001}           console=yes
    BuiltIn.Log          ***DSS DL Ratio: M55332C02001=${counter_values_M55332C02001}           console=yes
    BuiltIn.Log          ***DSS DL Ratio: ${counter_values_M55332C00001}/${counter_values_M55332C02001}           console=yes
    # Log to console  \n***DSS DL Ratio: ${counter_values_counter_values_1} ${counter_values_M55332C02001}  ***

    BuiltIn.Log       \n ***DSS DL Ratio: Number of DL Slots assigned to NR with maximum share (M55332C00002)            console=yes
    BuiltIn.Log          ***DSS DL Ratio: Number of DL Slots assigned to NR with minimum share (M55332C00003)            console=yes
    BuiltIn.Log          ***DSS DL Ratio: M55332C00002=${counter_values_M55332C00002}           console=yes
    BuiltIn.Log          ***DSS DL Ratio: M55332C00003=${counter_values_M55332C00003}           console=yes
    BuiltIn.Log          ***DSS DL Ratio: ${counter_values_M55332C00002}/${counter_values_M55332C00003}           console=yes

    ${dl_ratio}    Evaluate     (round(${counter_values_M55332C00001})/round(${counter_values_M55332C02001}))*100

    BuiltIn.Log          \n***DSS DL Ratio : ${dl_ratio}           console=yes

    BuiltIn.Log       \n ***DSS UL Ratio: Number of UL PRBs assigned to NR (M55332C01001)            console=yes
    BuiltIn.Log          ***DSS UL Ratio: Total number of available UL PRBs (M55332C02002)            console=yes
    BuiltIn.Log          ***DSS UL Ratio: M55332C01001=${counter_values_M55332C01001}            console=yes
    BuiltIn.Log          ***DSS UL Ratio: M55332C02002=${counter_values_M55332C02002}            console=yes
    BuiltIn.Log          ***DSS UL Ratio: ${counter_values_M55332C01001}/${counter_values_M55332C02002}           console=yes

    BuiltIn.Log       \n ***DSS UL Ratio: Number of UL PRBs assigned to NR with maximum share (M55332C01002)            console=yes
    BuiltIn.Log          ***DSS UL Ratio: Number of UL PRBs assigned to NR with minimum share (M55332C01003)            console=yes
    BuiltIn.Log          ***DSS UL Ratio: M55332C01002=${counter_values_M55332C01002}           console=yes
    BuiltIn.Log          ***DSS UL Ratio: M55332C01003=${counter_values_M55332C01003}            console=yes
    BuiltIn.Log          ***DSS UL Ratio: ${counter_values_M55332C01002}/${counter_values_M55332C01003}           console=yes

    ${ul_ratio}    Evaluate     (round(${counter_values_M55332C01001})/round(${counter_values_M55332C02002}))*100

    BuiltIn.Log        \n***DSS UL Ratio : ${ul_ratio}           console=yes

    # deviation_in_percent = 10 %, the target are 70% for DL DSS and 70 % for UL DSS , linked to DL and UL pattern used for the test
    ${min}=                         Evaluate                                70 * (100 - 10) / 100
    ${max}=                         Evaluate                                70 * (100 + 10) / 100
    ${status}=                      Evaluate                                ${min} <= ${dl_ratio} <= ${max}
    Run Keyword If                  '${status}'=='True'
    ...    Dated Log                Average DL DSS Ratio REACHED: expected = 70 , current = ${dl_ratio}
    ...    ELSE
    ...    Dated Log                Average DL DSS RATIO NOT REACHED: expected = 70, current = ${dl_ratio}
    Run Keyword If                  '${status}'!='True'                     Fail    DL DSS Ratio Failed

    ${min}=                         Evaluate                                75 * (100 - 10) / 100
    ${max}=                         Evaluate                                75 * (100 + 10) / 100
    ${status}=                      Evaluate                                ${min} <= ${ul_ratio} <= ${max}
    Run Keyword If                  '${status}'=='True'
    ...    Dated Log                Average UL DSS Ratio REACHED: expected = 75 , current = ${ul_ratio}
    ...    ELSE
    ...    Dated Log                Average UL DSS RATIO NOT REACHED: expected = 75, current = ${ul_ratio}
    Run Keyword If                  '${status}'!='True'                     Fail    UL DSS Ratio Failed

    # 5min = 300 s
    # DL RATIO = 70 %
    # 300 * 1000 * 0.7 = 210000
    # M55332C00002   Check value with tolerance = 10%
    ${min}=                         Evaluate                                210000 * (100 - 10) / 100
    ${max}=                         Evaluate                                210000 * (100 + 10) / 100
    ${status}=                      Evaluate                                ${min} <= ${counter_values_M55332C00002} <= ${max}
    Run Keyword If                  '${status}'=='True'
    ...    Dated Log                M55332C00002 value REACHED: expected = 210000 , current = ${counter_values_M55332C00002}
    ...    ELSE
    ...    Dated Log                M55332C00002 value NOT REACHED: expected = 210000, current = ${counter_values_M55332C00002}
    Run Keyword If                  '${status}'!='True'                     Fail    M55332C00002

    # check M55308C10001
    ${min}=                         Evaluate                                ${sum_prb_over_5min} * (100 - 10) / 100
    ${max}=                         Evaluate                                ${sum_prb_over_5min} * (100 + 10) / 100
    ${status}=                      Evaluate                                ${min} <= ${counter_values_M55308C10001} <= ${max}
    Run Keyword If                  '${status}'=='True'
    ...    Dated Log  M55308C10001 (PRBs used for PDSCH) value REACHED: expected = ${sum_prb_over_5min} , current = ${counter_values_M55308C10001}
    ...    ELSE
    ...    Dated Log  M55308C10001 (PRBs used for PDSCH) value NOT REACHED: expected = ${sum_prb_over_5min}, current = ${counter_values_M55308C10001}
    Run Keyword If                  '${status}'!='True'                     Fail    M55308C10001

    # KPI NR_5114a
    # Nbr PRB PDSCH / Nbr PRB PDSCH allocated to NR
    # Summarisation Formula:	(100*Sum([M55308C10001]) / Sum([M55308C10003]))

    # 95 % with CatM  => around 5 % Prb lost for nr
    # Cat M data => 2 RBG (8Prb) each slot except mbsfn slot
    # 2 records paging over 4 slots / 80 slots with 1 record = 2 RBG (8 Prb)
    # 2 records SiB1_Br over 4 slots / 80 slots with 1 record = 2 RBG (8 Prb)
    ${KPI_NR_5114a}    Evaluate     (round(${counter_values_M55308C10001})/round(${counter_values_M55308C10003}))*100
    # deviation_in_percent = 10 %, the target are 95% for KPI_NR_5114a
    ${min}=                         Evaluate                                95 * (100 - 10) / 100
    ${max}=                         Evaluate                                95 * (100 + 10) / 100
    ${status}=                      Evaluate                                ${min} <= ${KPI_NR_5114a} <= ${max}
    Run Keyword If                  '${status}'=='True'
    ...    Dated Log                KPI_NR_5114a REACHED: expected = 95 , current = ${KPI_NR_5114a}
    ...    ELSE
    ...    Dated Log                KPI_NR_5114a NOT REACHED: expected = 95, current = ${KPI_NR_5114a}
    Run Keyword If                  '${status}'!='True'                     Fail    KPI_NR_5114a


Check Tput over GP period to remove
    [Documentation]    Computes and checks the Tput UL and DL between start_per_time and end_per_time
    ...                Tputs should be equal to maximum Tputs all along the test, with 5% margin
    [Arguments]    ${nb_cell}=1    ${dl_expected_tput}=550    ${ul_expected_tput}=100
    BuiltIn.log     nb_cell is ${nb_cell}

    #M55319C00001: MEAS_PERIOD_NR_PDCP_REPORT1
    #M55319C0200x : DL_VOL_TX_NSA_QOS_GRP_0x: DL PDCP SDU volume transmitted for NSA Bearer - QoS Group 0x: nbre de bytes
    #M55319C02009 : Tput PDCP DL en bytes sur QoS 9
    #M55319C0600x: UL PDCP SDU volume received for NSA Bearer - QoS Group 0x: nbre de bytes
    #M55319C06009: Tput PDCP UL en bytes sur QoS 9

    #M55304C00001: Duration of the measurement period for the NR MAC PDU throughput
    # les compteurs suivants sont en bytes
    #M55304C01001 a 28: Initial transmission volume on PDSCH with 64QAM MCS table using MCS x, i.e Cell PDSCH without retrans Tput
    #M55304C02001 a 28: Initial and retransmission volume on PDSCH with 64QAM MCS table using MCS x, i.e Cell PDSCH with retrans Tput
    #M55304C03001 a 28: Initial transmissions volume on PUSCH with CP-OFDM and 64QAM MCS table using MCS x, i.e Cell PUSCH without retrans Tput
    #M55304C04001 a 28: Initial and retransmission volume on PUSCH with CP-OFDM and 64QAM MCS table using MCS x, i.e Cell PUSCH with retrans Tput
    #M55304C05001 a 28: Initial transmission volume on PDSCH with 256QAM MCS table using MCS x, i.e Cell PDSCH without retrans Tput
    #M55304C06001 a 28: Initial and retransmission volume on PDSCH with 256QAM MCS table using MCS x, i.e Cell PDSCH with retrans Tput

    ${NRCELL_ID}                       set variable       1
    # ${counter_values_M55319C02009}  Retrieve Latest Single Counter Value From Pm File with CellID    ${LATEST_FILE}    M55319C02009   ${NRCELL_ID}
    # ${counter_values_M55319C00001}  Retrieve Latest Single Counter Value From Pm File with CellID    ${LATEST_FILE}    M55319C00001   ${NRCELL_ID}
    ${counter_values_M55319C02009}     Retrieve Latest Single Counter Value From Pm File    ${LATEST_FILE}    M55319C02009
    ${counter_values_M55319C00001}     Retrieve Latest Single Counter Value From Pm File    ${LATEST_FILE}    M55319C00001
    BuiltIn.Log   ***DL PDCP SDU volume transmitted for NSA Bearer - QoS Group 09 (M55319C02009) = ${counter_values_M55319C02009}   console=yes
    BuiltIn.Log   ***Duration of the measurement period for the PDCP Report 1 (M55319C00001) = ${counter_values_M55319C00001}       console=yes

    ${Tput_PDCP_DL}                    set variable        ${counter_values_M55319C02009}
    ${MEAS_PERIOD_NR_PDCP_REPORT1}     set variable        ${counter_values_M55319C00001}

    ${tputDL}=              evaluate        8 * ${Tput_PDCP_DL} / (1000 * ${MEAS_PERIOD_NR_PDCP_REPORT1})
    Dated log          TPUT PDCP DL = ${tputDL} Mbps

    ${counter_values_M55319C06009}     Retrieve Latest Single Counter Value From Pm File     ${LATEST_FILE}   M55319C06009
    BuiltIn.Log   ***UL PDCP SDU volume received for NSA Bearer - QoS Group 09 (M55319C02009) = ${counter_values_M55319C06009}   console=yes
    ${Tput_PDCP_UL}                    set variable        ${counter_values_M55319C06009}

    ${tputUL}=              evaluate        8 * ${Tput_PDCP_UL} / (1000 * ${MEAS_PERIOD_NR_PDCP_REPORT1})
    Dated log          TPUT PDCP uL = ${tputUL} Mbps

    ${dl_min_tput}           evaluate    round(${dl_expected_tput}) * 0.9
    ${ul_min_tput}           evaluate    round(${ul_expected_tput}) * 0.9

    Should be true    ${tputDL} >= ${dl_min_tput}
    Should be true    ${tputUL} >= ${ul_min_tput}

Sum NbrOfPrb based on pcap traces
    [Arguments]                    ${param}
    ${nbr_dl_prb_allocated_to_nr}    set variable if    '${param.seq.bandwidth}'=='10MHz'     52
    ...                                                 '${param.seq.bandwidth}'=='15MHz'     79
    ...                                                                                       106
    # 70 % case
    # based on pcap analysis for 10MHz , NbrOfPrb = 4436 over 16 sfn
    # so, NbrOfPrb over 1024 sfn = 283904
    # based on pcap analysis for 20MHz , NbrOfPrb = 16366 over 20 sfn
    # so, NbrOfPrb over 1024 sfn = 837939
    # 100 % case
    # based on pcap analysis for 10MHz , NbrOfPrb = 7772 over 20 sfn
    # so, NbrOfPrb over 1024 sfn = 397926
    # based on pcap analysis for 20MHz , NbrOfPrb = 16366 over 20 sfn
    # so, NbrOfPrb over 1024 sfn = 837939
    # based on pcap analysis for 15mhz , NbrOfPrb = 10717 over 20 sfn
    # so, NbrOfPrb over 1024 sfn = 548710
    ${sum_dl_prb_allocated_to_nr_over_1024_sfn}    set variable if
    ...                            '${param.seq.bandwidth}'=='10MHz' and '${param.seq.assigned_dl_maximum_share_to_nr}'=='70'      283904
    ...                            '${param.seq.bandwidth}'=='10MHz' and '${param.seq.assigned_dl_maximum_share_to_nr}'=='100'     397926
    ...                            '${param.seq.bandwidth}'=='15MHz' and '${param.seq.assigned_dl_maximum_share_to_nr}'=='70'      384097
    ...                            '${param.seq.bandwidth}'=='15MHz' and '${param.seq.assigned_dl_maximum_share_to_nr}'=='100'     548710
    ...                            '${param.seq.bandwidth}'=='20MHz' and '${param.seq.assigned_dl_maximum_share_to_nr}'=='70'      586557
    ...                                                                                                                            837939
    Dated log     ==========> SumOfPrb from DlData_PdschSendReq pcap file
    # ${branch} is a test suite variable intialized during test suite setup Kw
    ${l1l2ItfVersion}=   Run Keyword And Return Status   Should Match Regexp     ${branch}     ^SBTS25R[2-9]|SBTS00$
    ${pattern}=    Run Keyword If    ${l1l2ItfVersion}   set variable     DlData_PdschSendReqL1sw
    ...               ELSE                               set variable     DlData_PdschSendReq
    # ${pattern}=     set variable if   '${mcshark_present}'=='${False}'    ICOM_5G/DlData_PdschSendReq
    # ...                                                                   DlData_PdschSendReq
    # ${SharkTool}=   set variable if   '${mcshark_present}'=='${False}'    LUA_SHARK
    # ...                                                                   MC_SHARK
    ${sum_prb}  ${cpt_sfn}   ${sum_prb_5min}  ${sum_dl_prb_allocated_to_nr}  ${dl_ratio}   ${dl_bler}=   nps_2574_tools.SumOfPrb_DlData_PdschSendReq
    ...                                                       nbr_dl_prb_allocated_to_nr=${nbr_dl_prb_allocated_to_nr}
    ...                                                       sum_dl_prb_allocated_to_nr_over_1024_sfn=${sum_dl_prb_allocated_to_nr_over_1024_sfn}
    ...                                                       pattern=${pattern}
    ...                                                       SharkTool=MC_SHARK
    [return]    ${sum_prb}   ${cpt_sfn}   ${sum_prb_5min}   ${sum_dl_prb_allocated_to_nr}   ${dl_ratio}   ${dl_bler}

Sum NbrOfPrb pdschsendreq from L1L2 Pcap
    [Documentation]                Generic test for 2574: test purpose is to test CatM info from L1L2 pcap
    [Arguments]                    ${param}   ${capture}
    Init Sequence                  ${param}
    Step                           Extract sfn, slot And nbOfPrb from _5g_l1_dl_l2_ps_dldata_pdschsendreq_t Pcap        argument=${capture}
    ${sum_prb}  ${cpt_sfn}  ${sum_prb_5min}  ${sum_dl_prb_allocated_to_nr}   ${dl_ratio}  ${dl_bler}=  Sum NbrOfPrb based on pcap traces    ${param}
    Dated log                      SumOfPrb pdschsendreq over ${cpt_sfn} sfn = ${sum_prb}
    Dated log                      SumOfPrb pdschsendreq over 5min = ${sum_prb_5min}
    Dated log                      SumOfPrb allocated to nr over ${cpt_sfn} sfn = ${sum_dl_prb_allocated_to_nr}
    Dated log                      DL Ratio [used for acceptance criteria] = ${dl_ratio} %
    Dated log                      DL BLER = ${dl_bler} %
    [return]     ${sum_prb}   ${sum_prb_5min}   ${dl_ratio}
    [Teardown]         GenericTest.Display diagnosis


Sum NbrOfPrb pdschsendreq from L1L2 Pcap wo Step
    [Documentation]                Generic test for 2574: test purpose is to test CatM info from L1L2 pcap
    [Arguments]                    ${param}   ${capture}
    Dated log     ==========> Extract sfn, slot And nbOfPrb from _5g_l1_dl_l2_ps_dldata_pdschsendreq_t Pcap
    Extract sfn, slot And nbOfPrb from _5g_l1_dl_l2_ps_dldata_pdschsendreq_t Pcap        ${capture}
    ${sum_prb}  ${cpt_sfn}   ${sum_prb_5min}  ${sum_dl_prb_allocated_to_nr}  ${dl_ratio}  ${dl_bler}=  Sum NbrOfPrb based on pcap traces    ${param}
    Dated log                      SumOfPrb pdschsendreq over ${cpt_sfn} sfn = ${sum_prb}
    Dated log                      SumOfPrb pdschsendreq over 5min = ${sum_prb_5min}
    Dated log                      SumOfPrb allocated to nr over ${cpt_sfn} sfn = ${sum_dl_prb_allocated_to_nr}
    Dated log                      DL Ratio [used for acceptance criteria] = ${dl_ratio} %
